AL123456.3	EMBL	CDS	1030578	1031864	.	-	0	ID=cds-CCP43672.1;Parent=gene-Rv0924c;Dbxref=EnsemblGenomes-Gn:Rv0924c,EnsemblGenomes-Tr:CCP43672,GOA:P9WIZ5,InterPro:IPR001046,NCBI_GP:CCP43672.1;Name=CCP43672.1;Note=Rv0924c%2C (MTCY21C12.18c)%2C len: 428 aa. MntH (alternative gene name: Nramp%2C Mramp)%2C H+-dependent divalent cation-transport integral membrane protein (see citations below)%2C equivalent to O69443|MNTH_MYCBO probable manganese transport protein MNTH (BRAMP) from Mycobacterium bovis (415 aa)%3B and NP_302396.1|NC_002677 probable manganese transport protein from Mycobacterium leprae (426 aa). Also similar (but longer 51 aa in N-terminus) to AAA63075.1|U15184 SMF2 protein from Mycobacterium leprae (377 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 1780%2C E(): 0%2C (74.5%25 identity in 376 aa overlap). Also similar to many orthologues of the eukaryotic Nramp (natural resistance-associated macrophage protein)%2C also known as mntH%2C e.g. NP_456951.1|NC_003198 manganese transport protein MntH from Salmonella enterica subsp. enterica serovar Typhi (413 aa)%3B etc. Belongs to the NRAMP family.;gbkey=CDS;gene=mntH;locus_tag=Rv0924c;product=Divalent cation-transport integral membrane protein MntH (BRAMP) (MRAMP);protein_id=CCP43672.1;transl_table=11
