AL123456.3	EMBL	CDS	1033840	1034631	.	-	0	ID=cds-CCP43675.1;Parent=gene-Rv0927c;Dbxref=EnsemblGenomes-Gn:Rv0927c,EnsemblGenomes-Tr:CCP43675,GOA:P9WGQ5,InterPro:IPR002198,InterPro:IPR002347,InterPro:IPR016040,InterPro:IPR020904,NCBI_GP:CCP43675.1;Name=CCP43675.1;Note=Rv0927c%2C (MTCY21C12.21c)%2C len: 263 aa. Probable short-chain dehydrogenase/reductase%2C similar to various dehydrogenases/reductases%2C notably 7-alpha-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenases and glucose 1-dehydrogenases e.g. P25529|HDHA_ECOLI 7-alpha-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase from Escherichia coli (255 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 551%2C E(): 1e-26%2C (39.5%25 identity in 248 aa overlap)%3B NP_252778.1|NC_002516 probable short-chain dehydrogenase from Pseudomonas aeruginosa (253 aa)%3B AAC44307.1|U59433 3-ketoacyl-acyl carrier protein reductase from Bacillus subtilis (246 aa)%3B etc. Also similar to other dehydrogenases from Mycobacterium tuberculosis e.g. MTCY09F9.36%2C E():1.4e-18%3B MTCY369.14%2C E():8e-17%3B MTCY02B10.14%2C E():2.5e-14%3B MTCY09F9.23c%2C E():1.5e-13%3B MTCY03C7.07%2C E():1.9e-13. Contains PS00061 Short-chain dehydrogenases/reductases family signature%2C and PS00017 ATP/GTP-binding site motif A (P-loop). Belongs to the short-chain dehydrogenases/reductases (SDR) family.;experiment=EXISTENCE: identified in proteomics study;gbkey=CDS;inference=protein motif:PROSITE:PS00061;locus_tag=Rv0927c;product=Probable short-chain type dehydrogenase/reductase;protein_id=CCP43675.1;transl_table=11
