AL123456.3	EMBL	CDS	1036028	1037002	.	+	0	ID=cds-CCP43677.1;Parent=gene-Rv0929;Dbxref=EnsemblGenomes-Gn:Rv0929,EnsemblGenomes-Tr:CCP43677,GOA:P9WG05,InterPro:IPR000515,InterPro:IPR011864,NCBI_GP:CCP43677.1;Name=CCP43677.1;Note=Rv0929%2C (MTCY21C12.23)%2C len: 324 aa. PstC2%2Cphosphate-transport integral membrane ABC transporter (see citations below)%2C highly similar to others e.g. NP_302394.1|NC_002677 membrane-bound component of phosphate transport from Mycobacterium leprae (319 aa)%3B CAB88474.1|AL353816 phosphate ABC transport system permease protein from Streptomyces coelicolor (336 aa)%3B NP_290359.1| NC_002655 high-affinity phosphate-specific transport system (cytoplasmic membrane component) from Escherichia coli strain O157:H7 (319 aa)%3B etc. Also similar to Rv935|MTCY08D9.04c|PSTC1 probable transmembrane ABC transporter component of phosphate uptake system from Mycobacterium tuberculosis (338 aa). Contains binding-protein-dependent transport systems inner membrane component signature (PS00402).;gbkey=CDS;gene=pstC2;inference=protein motif:PROSITE:PS00402;locus_tag=Rv0929;product=Phosphate-transport integral membrane ABC transporter PstC2;protein_id=CCP43677.1;transl_table=11
