AL123456.3	EMBL	CDS	1036999	1037925	.	+	0	ID=cds-CCP43678.1;Parent=gene-Rv0930;Dbxref=EnsemblGenomes-Gn:Rv0930,EnsemblGenomes-Tr:CCP43678,GOA:P9WG11,InterPro:IPR000515,InterPro:IPR005672,NCBI_GP:CCP43678.1;Name=CCP43678.1;Note=Rv0930%2C (MTCY21C12.24)%2C len: 308 aa. Probable pstA1%2Cphosphate-transport integral membrane ABC transporter (see citation below)%2C highly similar to others e.g. NP_302393.1|NC_002677 membrane-bound component of phosphate transport from Mycobacterium leprae (304 aa)%3B CAB88473.1|AL353816 phosphate ABC transport system permease protein from Streptomyces coelicolor (354 aa) (N-terminus longer)%3B NP_312689.1|NC_002695 phosphate transport system permease protein PstA from Escherichia coli strain O157:H7 (296 aa)%3B etc. Also similar to Rv0936|MTCY08D9.03c|PSTA2 probable transmembrane ABC transporter component of phosphate uptake system from Mycobacterium tuberculosis (301 aa).;gbkey=CDS;gene=pstA1;locus_tag=Rv0930;product=Probable phosphate-transport integral membrane ABC transporter PstA1;protein_id=CCP43678.1;transl_table=11
