AL123456.3	EMBL	CDS	1364413	1365186	.	+	0	ID=cds-CCP43977.1;Parent=gene-Rv1221;Dbxref=EnsemblGenomes-Gn:Rv1221,EnsemblGenomes-Tr:CCP43977,GOA:P9WGG7,InterPro:IPR007627,InterPro:IPR011991,InterPro:IPR013249,InterPro:IPR013324,InterPro:IPR013325,InterPro:IPR014284,NCBI_GP:CCP43977.1;Name=CCP43977.1;Note=Rv1221%2C (MTCI61.04)%2C len: 257 aa. SigE%2C alternative sigma factor of extracytoplasmic function (ECF) family (see citations below). Similar to many e.g. RPOE_HAEIN|P44790 RNA polymerase sigma-e factor from Haemophilus influenzae (189 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 247%2C E(): 3.4e-06%2C (28.5%25 identity in 186 aa overlap)%3B etc. Also similar to MTCY07D11.03 rpoE from Mycobacterium tuberculosis (35.2%25 identity in 159 aa overlap). Belongs to the sigma-70 factor family%2C ECF subfamily. Three promoters and three translational start codons have been detected (See Dona et al.%2C 2008). Fourth transcriptional start point has been identified (See Pang et al.%2C 2007). Note that in Mycobacterium bovis BCG%2C the sigE gene is transcribed from two promoters%2C P1 and P2%2C and that these promoters were expressed at temperatures from 30-50 degrees Celsius.;gbkey=CDS;gene=sigE;locus_tag=Rv1221;product=Alternative RNA polymerase sigma factor SigE;protein_id=CCP43977.1;transl_table=11
