AL123456.3	EMBL	CDS	2577108	2577701	.	+	0	ID=cds-CCP45088.1;Parent=gene-Rv2306A;Dbxref=EnsemblGenomes-Gn:Rv2306A,EnsemblGenomes-Tr:CCP45088,UniProtKB/TrEMBL:Q79FG5,NCBI_GP:CCP45088.1;Name=CCP45088.1;Note=Rv2306A%2C len: 197 aa. Possible conserved membrane protein%2C similar to several hypothetical membrane proteins from Mycobacterium tuberculosis and Streptomyces coelicolor%2C e.g. Rv0625c|P96915|Y625_MYCTU hypothetical 25.2 KDA protein from Mycobacterium tuberculosis (246 aa)%2CFASTA scores: opt: 410%2C E(): 2.7e-17%2C (53.25%25 identity in 139 aa overlap). First 140 aa show high similarity%2C this then decreases but continues in next ORF Rv2306B%2Csuggesting a frameshift near nt 2577473. However the sequence has been checked and no error found. The sequence is identical in CDC1551 and Mycobacterium bovis. Replaces original Rv2306c on other strand. This region is a possible MT-complex-specific genomic island (See Becq et al.%2C2007).;gbkey=CDS;locus_tag=Rv2306A;product=Possible conserved membrane protein;protein_id=CCP45088.1;transl_table=11
