AL123456.3	EMBL	CDS	2789280	2791022	.	-	0	ID=cds-CCP45277.1;Parent=gene-Rv2483c;Dbxref=EnsemblGenomes-Gn:Rv2483c,EnsemblGenomes-Tr:CCP45277,GOA:I6YDI9,InterPro:IPR002123,InterPro:IPR006383,InterPro:IPR006385,InterPro:IPR023214,UniProtKB/TrEMBL:I6YDI9,NCBI_GP:CCP45277.1;Name=CCP45277.1;Note=Rv2483c%2C (MTV008.39c)%2C len: 580 aa. Possible plsC%2C a transmembrane phospholipid biosynthesis bifunctional enzyme%2C including L-3-phosphoserine phosphatase and 1-acyl-Sn-glycerol-3-phosphate acyltransferase %2C equivalent to Q9X7A9|PLSC|ML1245 putative acyltransferase from Mycobacterium leprae (579 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 2835%2CE(): 9.2e-153%2C (77.15%25 identity in 573 aa overlap). C-terminal end is similar to many 1-acyl-SN-glycerol-3-phosphate acyltransferases (lysophosphatidic acidacyltransferases) e.g. Q9SDQ2 from Limnanthes floccosa (281 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 378%2C E(): 3.1e-14%2C (30.0%25 identity in 230 aa overlap) and Q42868|PLSC_LIMAL from Limnanthes alba (White meadowfoam) (281 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 374%2C E(): 5.2e-14%2C (30.55%25 identity in 221 aa overlap)%3B and the N-terminal end is similar to many SerB family proteins e.g. AAK44749|MT0526 from Mycobacterium tuberculosis strain CDC1551 (308 aa)%2CFASTA scores: opt: 356%2C E(): 5.8e-13%2C (32.5%25 identity in 298 aa overlap) and Q49823|ML2424 from Mycobacterium leprae (300 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 346%2C E(): 2.1e-12%2C (32.0%25 identity in 278 aa overlap). So belongs to the 1-acyl-SN-glycerol-3-phosphate acyltransferase family and may belong to the SerB family.;experiment=EXISTENCE: identified in proteomics study;gbkey=CDS;gene=plsC;locus_tag=Rv2483c;product=Possible transmembrane phospholipid biosynthesis bifunctional enzyme PlsC: putative L-3-phosphoserine phosphatase (O-phosphoserine phosphohydrolase) (PSP) (pspase) + 1-acyl-SN-glycerol-3-phosphate acyltransferase (1-AGP acyltransferase) (1-AGPAT) (lysophosphatidic acid acyltransferase) (LPAAT);protein_id=CCP45277.1;transl_table=11
