e deaminases family in the N-terminal section%3B and to the HTP reductase family in the C-terminal section.;experiment=EXISTENCE: identified in proteomics study;gbkey=CDS;gene=ribD;locus_tag=Rv2671;product=Possible bifunctional enzyme riboflavin biosynthesis protein RibD: diaminohydroxyphosphoribosylaminopyrimidine deaminase (riboflavin-specific deaminase) + 5-amino-6-(5-phosphoribosylamino)uracil reductase (HTP reductase);protein_id=CCP45469.1;transl_table=11
