in dehydrogenases/reductases (SDR) family.;experiment=EXISTENCE: identified in proteomics study;gbkey=CDS;inference=protein motif:PROSITE:PS00017;locus_tag=Rv3224;product=Possible iron-regulated short-chain dehydrogenase/reductase;protein_id=CCP46041.1;transl_table=11
