AL123456.3	EMBL	CDS	3706772	3707563	.	+	0	ID=cds-CCP46139.1;Parent=gene-Rv3319;Dbxref=EnsemblGenomes-Gn:Rv3319,EnsemblGenomes-Tr:CCP46139,GOA:O53371,InterPro:IPR001041,InterPro:IPR004489,InterPro:IPR009051,InterPro:IPR012675,InterPro:IPR017896,InterPro:IPR017900,InterPro:IPR025192,UniProtKB/TrEMBL:O53371,NCBI_GP:CCP46139.1;Name=CCP46139.1;Note=Rv3319%2C (MTV016.19)%2C len: 263 aa. Probable sdhB%2Ciron-sulphur protein succinate dehydrogenase SdhB subunit %2Cequivalent to Q49916|SDHB|ML0696|L308_F1_28 succinate dehydrogenase iron-sulfur protein from Mycobacterium leprae (264 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 1678%2C E(): 4.7e-99%2C (89.8%25 identity in 264 aa overlap). Also highly similar to other e.g. Q9KZ91|DHSB from Streptomyces coelicolor (257 aa)%2CFASTA scores: opt: 1125%2C E(): 4.6e-64%2C (64.1%25 identity in 262 aa overlap)%3B Q9RVS1|DR0951 from Deinococcus radiodurans (264 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 1014%2C E(): 5e-57%2C (57.25%25 identity in 255 aa overlap)%3B Q9PEF5|XF1073 from Xylella fastidiosa (261 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 681%2C E(): 5.8e-36%2C(45.1%25 identity in 244 aa overlap)%3B P07014|DHSB_ECOLI|SDHB|B0724 from Escherichia coli strain K12 (238 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 657%2C E(): 1.8e-34%2C (43.75%25 identity in 240 aa overlap)%3B etc. Contains PS00198 4Fe-4S ferredoxins%2C iron-sulfur binding region signature. Cofactor: binds three different iron-sulfur clusters: a 2FE-2S%2C a 3FE-4S and a 4FE-4S. The iron-sulfur centers are similar to those of 'plant-type' 2FE-2S and 'bacterial-type' 4FE-4S ferredoxins. Part of an enzyme complex containing four subunits: a flavoprotein%2C an iron-sulfur%2C cytochrome B-556%2C and an hydrophobic anchor protein.;experiment=EXISTENCE: identified in proteomics study;gbkey=CDS;gene=sdhB;inference=protein motif:PROSITE:PS00198;locus_tag=Rv3319;product=Probable succinate dehydrogenase (iron-sulphur protein subunit) SdhB (succinic dehydrogenase) (fumarate reductase) (fumarate dehydrogenase) (fumaric hydrogenase);protein_id=CCP46139.1;transl_table=11
