ranylgeranyl pyrophosphate synthetase [includes: dimethylallyltransferase%3B geranyltranstransferase%3B farnesyltranstransferase] from Mycobacterium tuberculosis (359 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 687%2C E(): 3.4e-36%2C (39.1%25 identity in 325 aa overlap). Contains PS00723 Polyprenyl synthetases signature 1. Belongs to the FPP/GGPP synthetases family.;experiment=EXISTENCE: identified in proteomics study;gbkey=CDS;gene=idsB;inference=protein motif:PROSITE:PS00723;locus_tag=Rv3383c;product=Possible polyprenyl synthetase IdsB (polyprenyl transferase) (polyprenyl diphosphate synthase);protein_id=CCP46204.1;transl_table=11
