AL123456.3	EMBL	CDS	3807574	3808437	.	-	0	ID=cds-CCP46213.1;Parent=gene-Rv3392c;Dbxref=EnsemblGenomes-Gn:Rv3392c,EnsemblGenomes-Tr:CCP46213,GOA:P9WPB7,InterPro:IPR003333,InterPro:IPR029063,PDB:1KP9,PDB:1KPG,PDB:1KPH,NCBI_GP:CCP46213.1;Name=CCP46213.1;Note=Rv3392c%2C (MTV004.50)%2C len: 287 aa. CmaA1%2Ccyclopropane mycolic acid synthase 1%2C characterized in 1995 as CFA1_MYCTU|Q11195|CMAA1|CMA1 cyclopropane-fatty-acyl-phospholipid synthase 1 (see citations below). Highly similar to Mycobacterium tuberculosis proteins MTCY20H10.23c (58.7%25 identity in 286 aa overlap)%3B MTCY20H10.24c (68.6%25 identity)%3B MTCY20H10.25c (73.5%25 identity)%3B MTCY20H10.26c (57.0%25 identity)%3B and MTCY20G9.30c (55.7%25 identity). Also highly similar to Q9CBK3|MMAA4|ML1903 methyl mycolic acid synthases from Mycobacterium leprae (298 aa)%2C FASTA scores: opt: 1098%2CE(): 1e-63%2C (57.0%25 identity in 286 aa overlap). Equivalent to AAK44898|MT0672 from Mycobacterium tuberculosis strain CDC1551 (317 aa) but shorter 30 aa and with some differences in residues between the proteins.;experiment=EXISTENCE: identified in proteomics study;gbkey=CDS;gene=cmaA1;locus_tag=Rv3392c;product=Cyclopropane-fatty-acyl-phospholipid synthase 1 CmaA1 (cyclopropane fatty acid synthase) (CFA synthase) (cyclopropane mycolic acid synthase 1);protein_id=CCP46213.1;transl_table=11
