AL123456.3	EMBL	CDS	4189285	4190232	.	-	0	ID=cds-CCP46565.1;Parent=gene-Rv3738c;Dbxref=EnsemblGenomes-Gn:Rv3738c,EnsemblGenomes-Tr:CCP46565,GOA:P9WHX1,InterPro:IPR000030,NCBI_GP:CCP46565.1;Name=CCP46565.1;Note=Rv3738c%2C (MTV025.086c)%2C len: 315 aa. PPE66%2C Member of the Mycobacterium tuberculosis PPE family%2C highly similar to many e.g. O53265|Rv3018c|MTV012.32c (434 aa)%2CFASTA scores: opt: 464%2C E(): 2.2e-17%2C (47.05%25 identity in 338 aa overlap). Probably a continuation of the upstream ORF MTV025.87c|Rv3739c|PPE67. At position 97470-72 a stop codon is present which interrupts a possibly longer ORF%2Cobserved in related ORFs MTV012_32 or MTCY21B4_4. The sequence has been checked and no errors were detected. A similar situation%2C but with a frameshift separating the ORFs is found in MTV012_36/MTV012_35. Sequence similarity is also seen with MTCY251_15%3B MTCY261_19%3B MLCB2492_30 from Mycobacterium leprae%3B MTCY10G2_10%3B MTY21C12_9%3B MTCI125_26%3B MTCY164_36%3B MTCY6A4_1.;gbkey=CDS;gene=PPE66;locus_tag=Rv3738c;product=PPE family protein PPE66;protein_id=CCP46565.1;transl_table=11
